  "prefLabel": "Env-WC 202.01 Place of Meetings",
  "priorExpiration": "2007-12-06",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-WC 202.01 Place of Meetings.\n\n(a) All regular meetings of the council shall be held at the department’s offices in Concord.\n\n(b) Special meeting, including meetings held to inform the public or solicit public comments, shall be held in Concord or such other place as the council shall determine based on consideration of maximizing access of interested persons to the meeting.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading Env-WC 200) #5469, eff 9-17-92, EXPIRED: 9-17-98\n\nNew. #6860, INTERIM, eff 10-1-98, EXPIRED: 1-29-99\n\nNew. #7011, eff 6-9-99; ss by #8892, INTERIM, eff 6-9-07, EXPIRES: 12-6-07; ss by #8977-A, eff 9-14-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wc200.html"
